Z||000000||RaeQwan||12-27-2000||09:28 PM||||At highway speeds (55-60mph), what should my tach be reading?<P>87 2.5l i4.. no goodies, bone stock. <P>I'm getting 3000rpm it dont seem right<BR><P>------------------<BR>     <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/raeqwanegg.gif"> ||||reg||5
Z||000001||FieroJoe||12-28-2000||12:07 AM||||nope, it doesnt seem right to me.  Or maybe my car is the wierd one?  87 2.5L, at 70 mph, 5th gear, I'm pulling about 2700rpms<P>is yours an automatic by any chance, because if it was I bet it definatly would run harder.<P>------------------<BR>FieroJoe<BR>c311t@yahoo.com<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/profile_1.JPG"> ||||reg||1
